==Battleground==
*2 [[Lucky Dags]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*4 [[Lucky Dags]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Cyberhorn in this level is at 100%, so it isn't a threat. The main threat in this level is the Metal One Horn, so don't forget to bring [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critters]]. Units with longer range such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon Cat]] are good options for taking out the Lucky Dags when at higher levels.

